[00:00.00] 作词 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Sean Cook/Nevin Sastry/John Mark Nelson
[00:00.00][by:Wabi-sabi_1213]
[00:00.00][by:龙叔的旅行听歌日记]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Sean Cook/Nevin Sastry/John Mark Nelson
[00:12.32]Just south of Leesburg
[00:12.32]利兹堡以南
[00:15.24]Where Billy fought with Reb
[00:15.24]曾有比利与叛军激战
[00:18.06]Some ran till their knees hurt
[00:18.06]有人跑到膝盖剧痛
[00:20.92]Till they couldn't feel their legs
[00:20.92]直到双腿失去知觉
[00:23.91]Tell me, why am I still running now?
[00:23.91]告诉我，为何如今我仍在奔逃？
[00:27.18]For freedom, I guess
[00:27.18]我想是为了自由
[00:30.15]To my forty acres
[00:30.15]奔向属于我的四十英亩土地
[00:32.76]Running full speed ahead
[00:32.76]全力向前奔跑
[00:36.22]And out west to the desert
[00:36.22]或是向西去往沙漠
[00:38.88]Where the sun shines forever
[00:38.88]那里阳光永恒照耀
[00:42.20]Or up north to the city
[00:42.20]或是北上奔向城市
[00:44.89]Make a few bad investments
[00:44.89]做几笔失败的投资
[00:48.22]I'm not one for gambling, but I'll take my chances
[00:48.22]我从不嗜赌，却愿放手一搏
[00:54.15]It's about time for a blessing
[00:54.15]是时候迎来赐福降临
[00:56.81]I won't settle for less
[00:56.81]我不愿退而求其次
[01:00.19]'Cause I know that out there's
[01:00.19]因为我知道远方有片土地
[01:03.17]A land full of dreams
[01:03.17]充满梦想的国度
[01:06.17]With milk, gold and honey
[01:06.17]流淌着奶与蜜的金色乐土
[01:09.12]Just waiting for me
[01:09.12]正等待我的到来
[01:11.60]So I'll pack me a little duffle
[01:11.60]于是我收拾好小小的行李袋
[01:14.78]Skip the goodbyes and leave
[01:14.78]省去告别径直离开
[01:18.18]'Cause East of the Massanutten
[01:18.18]因为在马萨纳滕山以东
[01:22.64]There's nothing for me
[01:22.64]再没有什么值得我留恋
[01:36.40]Met a believer
[01:36.40]曾遇见一位信徒
[01:39.17]Had all kinds of plans
[01:39.17]胸中满是宏伟蓝图
[01:42.16]Was drunk on ambition
[01:42.16]被野心灌得酩酊大醉
[01:45.18]No cards in his hands
[01:45.18]手中却无牌可出
[01:47.84]But you can't beat the dealer
[01:47.84]但你赢不了庄家
[01:51.12]So grab what you can
[01:51.12]所以能抓住什么就抓住什么
[01:53.81]If you wind up with nothing
[01:53.81]若最终落得一无所有
[01:56.82]Then you're better off dead
[01:56.82]那不如就此死去
